<item><title>Al-Shabaab seizes Coomaad village near Mataban in central Somalia</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/al-shabaab-seizes-coomaad-village-near-mataban-in-central-24225e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/al-shabaab-seizes-coomaad-village-near-mataban-in-central-24225e/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>Militants took the settlement after army troops pulled back from brief clashes, extending a run of gains in the region.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:14:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/al-shabaab-seizes-coomaad-village-near-mataban-in-central-24225e/share.jpg" length="44385" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/al-shabaab-seizes-coomaad-village-near-mataban-in-central-24225e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Somalia&apos;s president asks to visit Uganda again within two weeks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-s-president-asks-to-visit-uganda-again-within-two-f9c4f8/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/somalia-s-president-asks-to-visit-uganda-again-within-two-f9c4f8/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>Hassan Sheikh Mohamud wants a one-day meeting with Yoweri Museveni, his second trip to Uganda in a fortnight.</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:23:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>UN experts condemn president&apos;s removal of chief justice</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/un-experts-condemn-president-s-removal-of-chief-justice-cd3826/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/so/un-experts-condemn-president-s-removal-of-chief-justice-cd3826/</guid><category>Somalia</category><description>UN experts call Somalia president&apos;s dismissal of chief justice a blatant interference with judicial independence.</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:51:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" length="32841" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/so.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
